I've implemented both changes and the build succeeded. Here's what was done:

**`src/lib.rs`** — Added:
```rust
/// Returns notes whose `tags` contain exactly `tag`, preserving relative order.
pub fn filter_by_tag<'a>(notes: &'a [Note], tag: &str) -> Vec<&'a Note> {
    notes
        .iter()
        .filter(|n| n.tags.iter().any(|t| t == tag))
        .collect()
}
```

**`src/main.rs`** — The `list` command now:
1. Parses `--tag <TAG>` from remaining arguments
2. When provided, calls `filter_by_tag(&notes, tag)` to filter
3. Otherwise lists all notes (unchanged behavior)

Usage: `notekeep list --tag rust`

